  messages:
  - "H\xF4m nay l\xE0 m\u1ED9t ng\xE0y d\xE0i~~ Nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5 cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng
    \u0111\u1EC3 k\u1EBFt th\xFAc m\u1ED9t ng\xE0y th\xF4i!!!!"
  - "C\xE1 h\u1ED3i \xE2u l\u1EA1i ng\u1EE7 qu\xEAn r\u1ED3i, gi\xFAp b\u1EA1n \xFD
    ng\u1EE7 ngay ng\u1EAFn l\u1EA1i nh\xE1!"
  - "B\xE2y gi\u1EDD C\xE1 h\u1ED3i \u0111\xE3 ng\u1EE7 m\u1EA5t ti\xEAu r\xF9i n\xEAn
    kh\xF4ng c\xF3 g\u1EE3i \xFD s\u1EAFp x\u1EBFp n\xE0o cho b\u1EA1n c\u1EA3..."
  - "Nh\u01B0ng \u0111\u1EEBng lo!"
  - "C\xF3 baba t\u1ED1i n\xE0o c\u0169ng qua xem xem con g\xE1i nh\u01B0 th\u1EBF
    n\xE0o n\xEAn l\xE0 tho\xE1t m\xE9t - xen - g\u01A1 c\u1EE7a tui ra \u0111\u1EC3
    th\u1EA5y \u0111o\u1EA1n chat vs baba nha!"
